{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lunar Impact is a game in the adventure and science fiction genre.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try yourself as an astronaut who arrived on the Moon to study its harsh nature and mysterious anomalies. Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of life on our planet's satellite with its unusual landscapes and exciting missions that you have to complete. Build your base, create equipment, ride a lunar rover to explore the vast lunar seas, craters, lava caves. Overcome the challenges of extreme conditions for life, a constant lack of oxygen, dangerous natural phenomena such as meteorite showers, long moonquakes and other unknown anomalies. As a reward, you will receive an abundance of lunar resources and make many scientific discoveries!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features of the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lunar environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will recreate the natural conditions of the Moon for maximum immersion in the life of an astronaut. Lunar landscapes, rarefied atmosphere, gravity, a long day cycle, natural phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Moon is rich in various minerals, including those rare for Earth. Collecting and splitting the Moon's minerals will allow you to create equipment, construct buildings and machines needed to achieve your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crafting and Construction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create equipment and machines from lunar resources. Build your own unique lunar base using flexible construction mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-op</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game allows you to go to the Moon alone or with friends and family. Share adventures and discoveries together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fascinating plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interesting missions and tasks await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ATTENTION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is in early development stage. The planned release date of the demo version is summer 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the demo release, the game will be released in early access</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648060?t=1744209792","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648060/886b82944bbdbeab1aaf606182cbc86592ae6239/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744209792","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648060/9fb796a51d5451873c1ab97458046b35e9212b8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744209792","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648060/9fb796a51d5451873c1ab97458046b35e9212b8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744209792","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lunar Impact is a game in the adventure and science fiction genre.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try yourself as an astronaut who arrived on the Moon to study its harsh nature and mysterious anomalies. Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of life on our planet's satellite with its unusual landscapes and exciting missions that you have to complete. Build your base, create equipment, ride a lunar rover to explore the vast lunar seas, craters, lava caves. Overcome the challenges of extreme conditions for life, a constant lack of oxygen, dangerous natural phenomena such as meteorite showers, long moonquakes and other unknown anomalies. As a reward, you will receive an abundance of lunar resources and make many scientific discoveries!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features of the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lunar environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will recreate the natural conditions of the Moon for maximum immersion in the life of an astronaut. Lunar landscapes, rarefied atmosphere, gravity, a long day cycle, natural phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Moon is rich in various minerals, including those rare for Earth. Collecting and splitting the Moon's minerals will allow you to create equipment, construct buildings and machines needed to achieve your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crafting and Construction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create equipment and machines from lunar resources. Build your own unique lunar base using flexible construction mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-op</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game allows you to go to the Moon alone or with friends and family. Share adventures and discoveries together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fascinating plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interesting missions and tasks await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ATTENTION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is in early development stage. The planned release date of the demo version is summer 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the demo release, the game will be released in early access</p>","developers":["Artem Rumyantsev","Aliia Rumiantseva"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648060/48864115d09ec0d1daa9ce2bb7d83114